        "content": "<h4><strong>1. Ease Anxiety</strong></h4><p><strong>For:</strong> Pre-flight nerves, overstimulation, flying discomfort</p><ul><li><strong>Ear Seeds</strong>: Apply using the <em>Anxiety Ear Map</em> to soothe the nervous system.<br/><br/></li><li><strong>Headband</strong>: Wear pre-flight or in-transit to gently stimulate acupressure points that promote calm.<br/><br/></li><li><strong>Comb</strong>: Press the comb into your palm during turbulence or queues to help re-centre and calm.<br/><br/></li></ul><h4><strong>2. Support Sleep</strong></h4><p><strong>For:</strong> Jet lag, restless flights, winding down in a new time zone</p><ul><li><strong>Ear Seeds</strong>: Use the <em>Sleep Ear Map</em> to support deep rest.<br/><br/></li><li><strong>Headband</strong>: Wear for 10–15 minutes before bed to settle racing thoughts.<br/><br/></li><li><strong>Comb</strong>: Use during your wind-down ritual, gently pressing into the scalp or hands to help ease into rest.<br/><br/></li></ul><h4><strong>3. Aid Digestion</strong></h4><p><strong>For:</strong> Travel-related bloating, irregular meals, late dinners</p><ul><li><strong>Ear Seeds</strong>: Apply using the <em>Digestion Ear Map</em> to gently support digestive balance and ease bloating.<br/><br/></li></ul><h4><strong>4. Restore Energy</strong></h4><p><strong>For:</strong> Jet lag, fatigue, long-haul travel, late nights</p><ul><li><strong>Ear Seeds</strong>: Use the <em>Fatigue Ear Map</em> to help lift your natural energy.</li></ul><p></p><ul><li><strong>Headband</strong>: Wear in the morning or mid-afternoon to awaken and focus the mind.</li></ul>",
